单个符号信息量：
I(xi) = -log2 P(xi)

平均信息量：
H(X) = -Σ P(xi)log2 P(xi)

若每秒发送 Rs 个符号：
**Rb = Rs H(X)**

若 M 个符号等概率：
Hmax = log2 M

```markdown
H(X) = -ΣP(xi)log2P(xi)
     = -[0.4log2(0.4)+0.3log2(0.3)+0.2log2(0.2)+0.1log2(0.1)]
     ≈ 1.846 bit/符号

T = 1 ms = 0.001 s
RB = 1/T = 1000 Baud

Rb = RBH(X)
   = 1000 * 1.846
   = 1846 bit/s

Hmax = log2 4 = 2 bit/符号

Rbmax = RB**Hmax**
      = 1000 * 2
      = 2000 bit/s
```

